##########################################
# Product API Tests with Correlation Headers
##########################################

### 1. Get All Products (Empty initially)
GET {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: http-test-client
X-User-Id: tester@example.com

###

### 2. Create Product - With Correlation Headers
POST {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: create-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: product-management-app
X-User-Id: admin@example.com

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "High-performance laptop",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

###

### 3. Create Product - With IDs in Body
POST {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correlationId": "body-correlation-{{$randomUUID}}",
  "consumerId": "mobile-app",
  "userId": "mobile-user@example.com",
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse",
  "price": 29.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stockQuantity": 200
}

###

### 4. Create Product - With Nested Headers in Body
POST {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "header": {
    "correlationId": "nested-{{$randomUUID}}",
    "consumerId": "web-portal",
    "userId": "portal-admin@example.com"
  },
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB mechanical gaming keyboard",
  "price": 149.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stockQuantity": 75
}

###

### 5. Get All Products (Should have products now)
GET {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: getall-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: inventory-system
X-User-Id: inventory@example.com

###

### 6. Get Product By ID (Replace {id} with actual ID from create response)
GET {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product/1
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: getbyid-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: customer-app
X-User-Id: customer@example.com

###

### 7. Update Product (Replace {id} with actual ID)
PUT {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: update-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: product-management-app
X-User-Id: manager@example.com

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop - Updated",
  "description": "High-performance gaming laptop with RTX 4080",
  "price": 1599.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "stockQuantity": 45
}

###

### 8. Delete Product (Replace {id} with actual ID)
DELETE {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product/1
X-Correlation-Id: delete-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: product-management-app
X-User-Id: admin@example.com

###

### 9. Get Non-Existent Product (Should return 404)
GET {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/product/9999
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: notfound-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: test-client
X-User-Id: tester@example.com

###

##########################################
# Appointment API Tests
##########################################

### Get All Appointments
GET {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/GetAllAppointments
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: appt-list-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: appointment-system
X-User-Id: scheduler@example.com

###

### Create Appointment
POST {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/CreateAppointment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: appt-create-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: booking-app
X-User-Id: patient@example.com

{
  "title": "Annual Checkup",
  "description": "Regular health checkup",
  "startTime": "2024-12-20T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2024-12-20T11:00:00",
  "location": "Room 101",
  "attendeeEmail": "patient@example.com"
}

###

### Get Appointment By ID
GET {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/GetAppointmentById/1
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: appt-get-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: appointment-system
X-User-Id: scheduler@example.com

###

### Update Appointment
PUT {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/UpdateAppointment/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: appt-update-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: booking-app
X-User-Id: patient@example.com

{
  "title": "Annual Checkup - Rescheduled",
  "description": "Regular health checkup with blood work",
  "startTime": "2024-12-21T14:00:00",
  "endTime": "2024-12-21T15:00:00",
  "location": "Room 205",
  "attendeeEmail": "patient@example.com"
}

###

### Delete Appointment
DELETE {{RedactionCore_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/DeleteAppointment/1
X-Correlation-Id: appt-delete-{{$randomUUID}}
X-Consumer-Id: booking-app
X-User-Id: admin@example.com

###
